bru
---
name: Body Middleware - Form
description: Tests du parser form-urlencoded
---

POST http://localhost:3000/api/test/body
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

email=test@example.com&name=Jean&phone=0612345678

---
name: Form trop de clés
description: Retourne 400 FORM_TOO_MANY_KEYS
---

POST http://localhost:3000/api/test/body
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
X-Test-Max-Keys: 2

a=1&b=2&c=3

---
name: Form clé trop longue
description: Retourne 400 FORM_KEY_TOO_LONG
---

POST http://localhost:3000/api/test/body
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
X-Test-Key-Max: 5

averylongkey=value

---
name: Form prototype pollution
description: Retourne 400 PROTOTYPE_POLLUTION
---

POST http://localhost:3000/api/test/body
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

__proto__=evil
